  "notes": "Modified cash basis school district (Aug 31 2025). Governmental funds only (no enterprise funds; School Nutrition is a governmental special revenue fund). Receipts/disbursements/transfers from Exhibit D (p4) Total Major Governmental Funds column. Beginning/ending balances are the Exhibit D fund balances (cash and investments incl. fiscal agent cash and investments 127,518; ending_investments is informational, included in ending cash). Receipts are broad groups as printed in Exhibit D; Local Sources 3,325,019 split by category using the 1xxx local revenue lines of Exhibits F-K (split_from set; ties exactly). Other 25,664 = Employee Benefit Other 15,514 + Special Building insurance adjustments 10,150, which Exhibit K shows as other financing, but Exhibit D includes in receipts. Detail from Exhibits F-K by fund (zero-actual budget-only lines omitted, e.g. 2650, 2712, 1611). Transfers in Exhibits H, I, J and transfer out in Exhibit F (365,000) net to zero. Exhibit L/other pages not in trimmed PDF. Printed rounding differences recorded in report_discrepancies. Read pages 1-11 of 11."
